---
const editorPath = "/editor/editor.html";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0; url=${editorPath}`} />
		<title>写文章 - 辰萃</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<p>正在打开写作页面… <a href={editorPath}>如果没有自动打开，请点击这里。</a></p>
		<script is:inline define:vars={{ editorPath }}>
			window.location.replace(editorPath);
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
